    "University of West Bohemia in Pilsen\nReady to start?\nSet out on your UWB journey with the new mobile app. Keep all of your studies in your pocket and stay up to date wherever you are.\nAPP ZČU\nSubmit an e-application\nUniversity News\nMore news\nEvent Invitations\nMore Invitations\nPodcast UniverZ\nMore\nEUPeace Alliance\nWe are a proud member of the EUPeace Alliance – the European University for Peace, Justice, and Inclusive Societies.\nSafe University\nThe safety and well-being of our students and staff are our top priority.\nSustainability\nWe focus on the three pillars of sustainability at UWB: environmental protection, economic resilience, and social responsibility.\nUWB for Ukraine - ЗЧУ ДЛЯ УКРАЇНИ\nWe provide information and support for current and prospective students and staff from Ukraine.\n© ZČU 1991–Thu Oct 08 09:10:36 UTC 2026\nCS\nEN\nWebmaster\nCookies"
